OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FJust a few weeks ago, telling a Hull
OL,7,FCity supporter their side would be
OL,8,Fsitting third in the Premier League
OL,9,Fafter three games would have sounded
OL,10,Ffanciful at best.
OL,12,FYet it is not simply the points tally
OL,13,Fthat has caught the eye ` it is who
OL,14,FHull have taken them against.
OL,16,FTwo of their opening three opponents
OL,17,Fwill play in the Champions League this
OL,18,Fseason, while the other is a newly
OL,19,Fpromoted side that finished a sizeable
OL,20,F22 points clear of the Tigers in the
OL,21,FChampionship.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
