CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1788961696
OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FAnd while it still seems unlikely that
OL,7,FHull will remain in the European
OL,8,Fplaces over the course of the season,
OL,9,Ftheir first impression has already
OL,10,Fstrengthened the club's standing at a
OL,11,Ftime when Hull were increasingly being
OL,12,Fportrayed as a side that did not
OL,13,Fbelong at this level.
OL,15,FAs Ollie McBurnie said following their
OL,16,Fvictory over Coventry: "To say we're
OL,17,Fthe worst team in Premier League
OL,18,Fhistory - it's not a bad start from
OL,19,Fthe boys."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
