OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FIn defence of the skeptics, Hull's
OL,7,Funderlying data in the Championship
OL,8,Fwas a concern heading into the season
OL,9,F` with serious questions about their
OL,10,Fdefence.
OL,12,FThey conceded 66 goals in the
OL,13,FChampionship last season. Only three
OL,14,Fteams let in more.
OL,16,FNow, not a single team has found a way
OL,17,Fpast them ` Hull are the only side
OL,18,Facross England's 92 professional clubs
OL,19,Fyet to concede.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
