OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1788961696
OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FTheir latest clean sheet came in
OL,7,FSaturday's goalless draw with Aston
OL,8,FVilla, a game Hull could have won, if
OL,9,Fa shot from Mohamed Belloumi's had
OL,10,Fbeen a few millimetres lower.
OL,12,FNevertheless, another good point for
OL,13,FSergej Jakirovic's men.
OL,15,FSo, how have they done it?
OL,17,FFight, togetherness, work rate - all
OL,18,Fqualities exuded by the coach Sergej
OL,19,FJakirovic. What a job he has done with
OL,20,Fthis team.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
