OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FThey always say the strongest
OL,7,Fstructures are built on solid
OL,8,Ffoundations.
OL,10,FWhen goalkeeper Konstantinos Tzolakis
OL,11,Fsigned for around #20 million from
OL,12,FOlympiacos, it was a fee that broke
OL,13,Fthe club's transfer record and brought
OL,14,Fpressure with it.
OL,16,FBut the Greek has looked composed and
OL,17,Fappears to have instilled a new sense
OL,18,Fof confidence in the defence as a
OL,19,Fwhole.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
