CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1788961696
OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FHaving just 26% possession against
OL,7,FVilla would normally spell trouble,
OL,8,Fbut Hull's defence seemed happy to
OL,9,Fabsorb that pressure and leave with
OL,10,Fanother clean sheet.
OL,12,FTzolakis has not done it alone.
OL,13,FDefender Nobel Mendy was another major
OL,14,Faddition, breaking the club's transfer
OL,15,Frecord for a second time during the
OL,16,Fsummer.
OL,18,FAt just 22, however, he has quickly
OL,19,Fmade that fee look like a bargain,
OL,20,Femerging as a revelation at the back.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
