CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1788961696
OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FAnd it is not just the new signings
OL,7,Fwho have raised their level, but
OL,8,Fplayers who were deemed to be in the
OL,9,Ftwilight of their careers.
OL,11,F33 year-old John Egan was picked up as
OL,12,Fa free agent by Burnley just two years
OL,13,Fago, but the Irishman is now arguably
OL,14,Fplaying the best football of his career
OL,16,FThe same could be said of Semi Ajayi,
OL,17,Fwhose biggest transfer fee came more
OL,18,Fthan a decade ago, when he moved for
OL,19,Fjust #450,000.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1788961696
OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FAjayi was incredible against
OL,7,FManchester United. His goal was his
OL,8,Ffirst in the top-flight since 2021 for
OL,9,FWest Brom and, even more importantly,
OL,10,Fhe was impenetrable at the back.
OL,12,FThere are still plenty of new signings
OL,13,Fto bed in, with six players arriving
OL,14,Fon deadline day alone. But retaining
OL,15,Fthe likes of Belloumi, McBurnie,
OL,16,FCrooks, Slater, Hughes and Egan is
OL,17,Fjust as significant, with the new
OL,18,Fcontracts representing a clear
OL,19,Fstatement of intent from the club.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
