FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1788961696
OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FIt is, of course, still early days,
OL,7,Fbut the results have brought more than
OL,8,Fjust points ` they have lifted the
OL,9,Fmood around the club, too. The flying
OL,10,Fstart has thrust Hull into the online
OL,11,Fspotlight, with the "Mauled by the
OL,12,FTigers" chant becoming something of a
OL,13,Fmedia sensation.
OL,15,FThough somewhat tongue-in-cheek, the
OL,16,Ffeel good factor around the club, and
OL,17,Fthe visibility it is enjoying on
OL,18,Ffootball's biggest stage, is anything
OL,19,Fbut.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1788961696
OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FIn a similar vein, the club's highly
OL,7,Factive social media team has been
OL,8,Fcapitalising on the attention, posting
OL,9,Fclips to TikTok and Instagram that
OL,10,Fhave gone viral.
OL,12,FKey moments from games are cut
OL,13,Ftogether with online memes, giving
OL,14,FHull's content a distinctly modern and
OL,15,Fshareable feel.
OL,17,FBut ultimately, the football has to do
OL,18,Fthe talking ` and Hull's performances
OL,19,Fare what have got them this far.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
