OL,3,CHow Hull City have defied the odds in
OL,4,Cthe Premier League
OL,6,FNo promoted team has ever been
OL,7,Frelegated after winning seven points
OL,8,Ffrom their first three games in
OL,9,FPremier League history.
OL,11,FAnd regardless of how far this level
OL,12,Fcan be sustained, that statistic
OL,13,Fshould give fans plenty of reason for
OL,14,Foptimism and hope that the mauling
OL,15,Fwill continue...
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
